  "reasoning": "The facts show that the defendant repeatedly stole electric cable lines from construction sites, with a total value of 26,653.69 yuan, which meets the elements of theft (盗窃). Additionally, the defendant illegally took a vehicle that had been lawfully seized and detained by a court, constituting the crime of illegally disposing of seized property (非法处置扣押的财产). No other offenses are supported by the facts.",
